{
  "title": "Ziyarate Janabe Muslim (a.s.)",
  "data": "سَلاَمُ اللّٰهِ الْعَلِیِّ الْعَظِیْمِ\nsalamu allahi al`aliyyi al`azimi\nThe peace of Allah, the High, the Great,\nوَسَلاَمُ مَلٰٓئِكَۃِ الْمُقَرَّبِیْنَ\nwa salamu mala'ikati almuqarrabina\nand the peace of the angels who are near (to Him),\nوَاَنْبِیَائِهِ الْمُرْسَلِیْنَ\nwa anbiya'ihi almursalina\nand His messenger-prophets,\nوَاَئِمَّتِهِ الْمُنْتَجِبِیْنَ\nwa a'immatihi almuntajabina\nand His chosen Imams,\nوَعِبَادِهِ الصّٰلِحِیْنَ\nwa `ibadihi alssalihina\nand His righteous servants,\nوَجَمِیْعِ الشُّهَدَآئِ وَالصِّدِّیْقِیْنَ\nwa jami`i alshshuhada'i walssiddiqina\nand all the martyrs and the truthful ones,\nوَالزَّاكِیَاتُ الطَّیِّبَاتُ فِیْ مَا تَغْتَدِیْ وَتَرُوْحُ عَلَیْكَ\nwalzzakiyati alttayyibati fima taghtadi wa taruhu `alayka\nand the pure, goodly ones, morning and evening, be upon you,\nیَا مُسْلِمَ ابْنَ عَقِیْلِ ابْنَ اَبِیْ طَالِبٍ\nya muslima bna `aqilin bna abi talibin\nO Muslim, son of `Aqil, son of Abu Talib.\nاَلسَّلاَمُ عَلَیْكَ اَیُّهَا الْعَبْدِ الصَّالِحُ الْمُطِیْعُ لِلّٰهِ\nalssalamu `alayka ayyuha al`abdu alssalihu almuti`u lillahi\nPeace be upon you, O righteous servant, obedient to Allah\nوَلِرَسُوْلِهٖ وَلِاَمِیْرُ الْمُؤْمِنِیْنَ وَالْحَسَنِ وَالْحُسَیْنِ\nwa lirasulihi wa li'amiri almu'minina wa alhasani wa alhusayni\nand to His Messenger, and to the Commander of the Faithful, and al-Hasan and al-Husain,\nصَلَوٰتُ اللّٰهِ عَلَیْهِمْ اَجْمَعِیْنَ\nsalawatu allahi `alayhim ajma`ina\nAllah’s blessings be upon them all.\nاَشْهَدُ اَنَّكَ لَمْ تَهِنْ وَلَمْ تَنْكُلْ\nashhadu annaka lam tahin wa lam tankul\nI bear witness that you did not weaken, nor did you flinch,\nوَاِنَّكَ قَدْ مَضَیْتَ عَلیٰ بَصِیْرَۃٍ مِنْ اَمْرِكَ\nwa innaka qad madayta `ala basiratin min amrika\nand that you went forth with insight into your affair,\nمُقْتَدِیاً بِالصّٰلِحِیْنَ وَمُتَّبِعاً لِلنَّبِیِّیْنَ\nmuqtadiyan bilssalihina wa muttabi`an lilnnabiyyina\nfollowing the example of the righteous, and the way of the prophets.\nفَجَمَعَ اللّٰهُ بَیْنَنَا وَبَیْنَكَ وَبَیْنَ رَسُوْلِهٖ\nfajama`a allahu baynana wa baynaka wa bayna rasulihi\nMay Allah gather us together with you and with His Messenger,\nوَاَوْلِیَائِهٖ فِیْ مَنَازِلِ الْمُخْبِتِیْنَ\nwa awliya'ihi fi manazili almukhbitina\nand His intimate friends, in the abodes of the humble ones,\nفَاِنَّهٗ اَرْحَمُ الرَّاحِمِیْنَ۔\nfa'innahu arhamu alrrahimina\nfor indeed He is the most Merciful of the merciful."
}
